<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baan cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baan cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst Andrew Roskill reduced his rating for Dutch software company Baan Co NV Thursday to neutral from outperform, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The downgrade was based on the stock's valuation.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) were trading down 5-1/4 at 70-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
